cff-version: 1.2.0
title: GAID AI Development Index
message: >-
  If you use this software or the index it produces, please cite both this
  repository and the underlying Global AI Dataset deposit.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jason
    family-names: Hung
  - given-names: Nicolas
    family-names: Grossman
repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/newlivehung123123/GAID-Project_AI_Development_Index
url: https://gaid.aiinsocietyhub.com/
abstract: >-
  A six-pillar composite index of national artificial intelligence development
  for 227 countries and territories, built from the Global AI Dataset (GAID)
  Project wave 1 version 2. The pipeline downloads the deposited wave from
  Harvard Dataverse, verifies its checksum, harmonises it into a canonical
  panel, and computes annual editions under nested equal weights with published
  coverage gates and a full validation suite.
keywords:
  - composite indicator
  - artificial intelligence
  - national AI capacity
  - open data
  - reproducibility
license: MIT
references:
  - type: data
    title: Global AI Dataset (GAID) Project, wave 1, version 2
    authors:
      - given-names: Jason
        family-names: Hung
    doi: 10.7910/DVN/PUMGYU
    year: 2026
    publisher:
      name: Harvard Dataverse
